---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-86-health-public-health-disability-population-wellbeing-registry.json";

const access = registry.primary_preventive_community_care_access_dossiers;
const care = registry.acute_emergency_specialty_behavioral_health_care_ledgers;
const publicHealth = registry.public_health_surveillance_prevention_environmental_exposure_registers;
const wellbeing = registry.disability_equity_preparedness_population_wellbeing_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Health, Public Health And Population Wellbeing | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive health-access, clinical-care, public-health, disability, preparedness, recovery, and population-wellbeing records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-health-population-wellbeing-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Health And Wellbeing</div><h1 class="page-title">Nominal capacity is not timely access, and an encounter is not a health outcome.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 86 traces whether people can obtain affordable, accessible, safe care; whether public-health signals lead to proportionate support without diagnosis by proxy; and whether disability rights, preparedness, recovery, equity, and long-horizon population wellbeing are protected.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive access dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive care ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive public-health registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive wellbeing ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 health decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Primary, Preventive And Community Care</div><h2>Eight access dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/primary-preventive-community-care-access-001/">Read the health-access guide</a></div><div class="grid">{access.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.access_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/health-population-wellbeing/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Need, attachment, timeliness, geography, accessibility, language, Indigenous jurisdiction, rural reach, complete household cost, prevention, continuity, workforce, quality, equity, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Acute, Emergency, Specialty And Behavioral Care</div><h2>Eight care ledgers contain no clinical finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/acute-emergency-hospital-critical-care-001/">Read the acute-care guide</a></div><div class="grid">{care.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.care_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/health-population-wellbeing/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.acute_emergency_specialty_behavioral_health_care_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Response, triage, transfer, hospital, specialty, mental-health, substance-use, life-course care, medicines, beds, waits, workers, safety, discharge, continuity, affordability, and review remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Public Health, Surveillance And Exposure</div><h2>Eight public-health registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/public-health-surveillance-vaccination-outbreak-001/">Read the public-health guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{publicHealth.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/health-population-wellbeing/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.public_health_surveillance_prevention_environmental_exposure_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Authority, denominators, case definitions, laboratory and community signals, vaccination, outbreak response, environmental and occupational exposure, climate health, restrictions, communication, remediation, burden, recovery, rights, and review remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.public_health_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Disability, Equity, Preparedness And Population Wellbeing</div><h2>Eight wellbeing ledgers contain no recovery finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/health-preparedness-recovery-population-wellbeing-001/">Read the population-wellbeing guide</a></div><div class="grid">{wellbeing.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/health-population-wellbeing/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.disability_equity_preparedness_population_wellbeing_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Disability rights, accessible care, community supports, social determinants, equity, Indigenous jurisdiction, mental health, plans, exercises, stockpiles, surge, continuity, restoration, backlog, morbidity, mortality, function, participation, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.wellbeing_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty health and population-wellbeing state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without assigning eligibility; diagnosing or triaging anyone; issuing care-quality, safety, surveillance, exposure, disability, preparedness, recovery, or wellbeing findings; authorizing restrictions; or creating a receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/health-public-health-disability-population-wellbeing.json">Health and population-wellbeing JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
